WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:02.054
-I can make a good steak.
-Uh-huh.

00:00:02.262 --> 00:00:04.306
Uh, chicken,
but nothing too fancy.

00:00:04.406 --> 00:00:06.141
-My food's pretty bland.
-Uh-huh.

00:00:06.266 --> 00:00:08.277
I make a good--
I make a good cake though.

00:00:08.427 --> 00:00:09.561
I know how to bake a cake.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:10.963
-You know how to bake a cake?
-Yeah.

00:00:11.046 --> 00:00:12.644
Not, you know,
not, uh, you know,

00:00:12.744 --> 00:00:14.504
something from a bakery
or from anything else.

00:00:14.612 --> 00:00:15.842
But just a...

00:00:16.332 --> 00:00:18.604
good, yellow cake
with chocolate frosting,

00:00:18.754 --> 00:00:19.817
or vanilla frosting.

00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:20.947
♪ (CONTRABASSOON PLAYING) ♪

00:00:21.036 --> 00:00:23.600
Huh. Never seen an instrument
like this before.

00:00:23.813 --> 00:00:25.248
Yeah, it's a contrabassoon.

00:00:25.348 --> 00:00:27.729
It's the lowest instrument
in the entire orchestra.

00:00:28.197 --> 00:00:29.277
Huh. Oh, cool.

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:34.670
♪ (CONTINUES PLAYING) ♪

00:00:34.929 --> 00:00:36.964
Yeah. So, no. I-- (CHUCKLES)

00:00:37.089 --> 00:00:38.215
I-- no-- no one--

00:00:38.357 --> 00:00:39.908
I'd never even cooked
for anybody.

00:00:40.058 --> 00:00:40.958
-(LAUGHS)
-Oh, okay.

